  "idea": "How to extract text from a screenshot or image without retyping it",
  "text": "Stop manually retyping text from images, scanned receipts, or screenshots. Squinting at a receipt while manually typing tracking codes into Excel invites instant errors. Manual transcription wastes valuable working hours and risks costly invoicing mistakes across your books. Open the screenshot with Snipping Tool, click Text Actions, and copy recognized text with one click. The built-in OCR extracts every letter and digit with pinpoint accuracy.",
